# Multi-Agent Support Automation System

An asynchronous, Kafka-driven multi-agent system for triaging and processing incoming support requests.

This project demonstrates a lightweight event-driven architecture where:
- Requests are ingested through a FastAPI endpoint or ingestion worker
- A classification agent routes each request by category
- Specialized agents handle billing and technical cases
- Audit and escalation streams are generated for governance and human handoff
- Prometheus-compatible metrics can be exposed for monitoring

